{"kind":"note","note_type":"basic","fields":["Buddhists have four pilgrimage sites, closely linked to the life of Siddhartha Guatama (known as Buddha). This was the city where he sat under a peepal tree, meditating for three days and three nights until he attained Enlightenment.","Bodh Gaya"],"tags_json":"[\"trivia\",\"world\",\"source:open-trivia-qa\",\"license:cc-by-sa-4.0\"]"}
